</header>

<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we do.</h2><p class="lead">One operator for the cut, the fill and the finished levels - so the pad is left ready for what comes next.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Site cuts & pad preparation</h3><p>Bulk and detailed cuts to design level. Laser-controlled finish, compacted and certified ready for slab or structure.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Trenching</h3><p>Services, drainage and footings trenches cut to exact depth and fall. Clean spoil management, backfill on request.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Land clearing</h3><p>Vegetation removal, root raking and site stripping. Green waste mulched or carted - site left clean for the next phase.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Detailed excavation</h3><p>Footings, piers, basement cuts and service pits. Tight tolerances, minimal over-dig, material handled once.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="cap-band" id="capability"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">How we work.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="cap-grid">
    <div class="cap rv"><h3>Laser-guided grading</h3><p>Dual-grade laser on every pad. Cut and fill tracked in real time - the surface reads level before we pack up.</p></div>
    <div class="cap rv"><h3>Grade stakes & targets</h3><p>Staked at 5m grid with laser receivers. Cut/fill called at each stake, spoil pushed to fill zones, final pass with the bucket.</p></div>
    <div class="cap rv"><h3>Single-machine flow</h3><p>One excavator does the cut, the push and the finish. No hand-offs, no double-handling, no arguments on level.</p></div>
    <div class="cap rv"><h3>Spoil balance</h3><p>Cut volume matches fill volume on the pad. Excess carted only when the design demands it - cost and carbon saved.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

